WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.720
Tesla Cybercab drew crowds during Hangzau public tours as interest builds ahead of planned commercial

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:13.160
launches in Nevada and Florida. This is Tesla Shorts Time, episode 618. Over the past week,

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:19.500
several threads stood out across Tesla coverage. FSD approvals advanced in individual European

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:25.800
countries even as the broader EU vote slipped. Production milestones at Gigatexas included

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:32.380
it first SymerCab cathode material and semi-range updates with in-house cells. Powerwall expansion

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:38.640
options open for existing owners in multiple markets. Wikipedia updated its Elon Musk entry

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:45.120
with fresh net worth figures. According to Tesla Rotti, the page now lists him as CEO and largest

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:52.180
shareholder of both Tesla and SpaceX. It notes he has held the title of wealthiest person since 2025.

00:00:52.180 --> 00:00:56.500
Forbes puts the current figure at $964 billion.

00:00:57.260 --> 00:01:02.100
The entry also records his brief period as the only trillionaire back in June.

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:05.880
The Tesla Century City showroom stands nearly empty.

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:12.800
Tesla Roddy reports only a single model YL remains on site along with a self-driving video loop.

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:16.840
Observers read the change as a sign of strong quarterly deliveries.

00:01:16.840 --> 00:01:21.780
batteries. The CyberCab generated noticeable interest during its public tour in Hangzhou.

00:01:22.580 --> 00:01:29.000
TSLA AMING posted that the vehicle drew strong crowds throughout the event in China. The

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:34.460
positive reception came ahead of planned commercial service starts. Battery safety discussions

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:41.220
highlighted Tesla's isolate contained vent approach. TSLA AMING explained that cutting

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:46.440
electrical feed prevents neighboring cells from feeding energy into a fault. The failing

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:52.060
Cell still produces heat and gas so the design adds a retained collar and upward vent path.

00:01:52.940 --> 00:01:56.320
Cybercabs continue preparations for initial commercial service.

00:01:56.960 --> 00:02:02.400
TSLA AMING noted launches are targeted for Nevada and Florida with a possible

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:07.840
California expansion by the middle of next year. Tesla is advancing full self-driving

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:14.280
supervised talks directly with Irish authorities. Not a Tesla app reports the European Union pushed

00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:21.180
its block-wide vote from October 6th to December at the earliest. Czech Republic became the 7th European

00:02:21.180 --> 00:02:27.520
market to grant approval earlier this week. Tesla has already logged more than 15,000 cumulative

00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:33.700
deliveries in Ireland. A newly published patent describes an active rear wing for the next roadster.

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:39.260
Not a Tesla app covered the filing that claims up to 700 kilograms of downforce.

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:45.760
the system also includes a DRS mode and a pre-crash folding function. A parking

00:02:45.760 --> 00:02:51.080
law in Houston now holds a large number of cybercabs. EVANX reports many of

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:55.480
the vehicles carry steering wheels and starlink receivers, marking them as test

00:02:55.480 --> 00:03:00.900
units. Houston's current geofence remains the smallest in Texas at 21 square

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:06.780
miles. CATL cells from the world's first large-scale storage project still

00:03:06.780 --> 00:03:12.780
operate after 14 years. Inside EVs notes none of the original cells have been replaced

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:19.200
and they remain suitable for another decade. The test covered real grid duty cycles on LFP

00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:25.040
Prismatic Chemistry. New FSD builds include an automatic collision evasion feature.

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:30.360
Not a Tesla app released video showing the system taking over steering to avoid hazards.

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:35.340
The capability marks the first public demonstration of that intervention logic.

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:39.300
space X completed another classified Pentagon launch.

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:44.720
Tesla Roddy reports the USS F-385 mission lifted off from Vandenberg

00:03:44.920 --> 00:03:47.120
with a 10th flight booster landing.

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:51.020
The flight adds to suspected star shield infrastructure work.

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:56.480
The Model S has now run 14 years on a single generation with multiple updates.

00:03:57.140 --> 00:04:01.760
Carbuzz notes it arrived in 2012 as the first truly premium electric car.

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:07.160
The vehicle demonstrated that an EV could combine speed, range, and desirability.

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:11.720
A drone was filmed cleaning windows at the star-based launch control room.

00:04:12.300 --> 00:04:16.080
Tesla Roddy shared footage of the maintenance operation at the Texas facility.

00:04:16.740 --> 00:04:21.500
Tesla produces semi-seats and seat belts inside the same factory that builds the truck.

00:04:22.140 --> 00:04:25.880
The Reddit thread confirms built-in safety features on both components.

00:04:26.560 --> 00:04:30.980
The refreshed semi in Nevada carries an updated heat pump and drive train.

00:04:30.980 --> 00:04:36.800
Not a Tesla app reports these changes arrived alongside the high-volume assembly lines.

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:41.200
Motor trends secured seat time in the 500-mile Tesla semi.

00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:46.620
The review covered hill climbs, acceleration range, and charging on the production vehicle.

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:52.320
A clean-technica discussion explores whether unsupervised FSD could arrive soon.

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:56.940
The post also covers additional conversations with the GROC AI bot.

00:04:56.940 --> 00:05:04.180
A California agency lawsuit alleging race discrimination at the Fremont factory heads to trial on Monday.

00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:09.120
Clean Technica notes the case is one of several similar actions against the company.

00:05:09.840 --> 00:05:14.120
Elon Musk attended the semi-factory opening only through a pre-recorded video.

00:05:14.740 --> 00:05:20.940
Battery longevity testing rarely receives the same attention as peak energy density or fast charge weights.

00:05:20.940 --> 00:05:27.280
The CATL cells that powered the world's first large-scale storage project still operate

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:29.760
after 14 years with zero replacements.

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:35.340
That result shifts the economics of stationary storage because replacement cycles move from

00:05:35.340 --> 00:05:38.120
a recurring cost into a distant future expense.

00:05:39.020 --> 00:05:43.800
Vehicle batteries face different duty cycles than grid units, yet the same chemistry lessons

00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:48.260
apply when Tesla designs packs for both Cybertruck and Megapack lines.

00:05:48.260 --> 00:05:54.420
If a cell chemistry can retain capacity after 14 years of daily cycling, the capital

00:05:54.420 --> 00:05:58.220
cost per kilowatt hour delivered over the pack's life drops sharply.

00:05:58.980 --> 00:06:04.300
Manufacturers can therefore price longer warranties or larger energy buffers without eroding

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:04.780
margins.

00:06:05.560 --> 00:06:08.920
The practical implication reaches beyond Tesla's own products.

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:15.680
Utilities evaluating 15-year asset lives now have field data that supports financing models

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:17.120
once considered optimistic.

00:06:17.120 --> 00:06:22.800
When replacement intervals stretch that far, the levelized cost of storage falls enough

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:28.020
to accelerate coal plant retirements in regions where solar-plus storage already competes

00:06:28.020 --> 00:06:28.480
on price.

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:34.980
Before we go, the next updates on Irish FSD talks and Houston CyberCab testing are worth

00:06:34.980 --> 00:06:35.360
watching.

